{
  "$description": "Lumen design tokens — canonical source of the theme-token pipeline (doc 08 §3.1, card 1.B4). Re-pinned 2026-11-11 to the W25 Figma redesign measured values (design/figma-fidelity-spec.md §1; mined from design/figma/ — 102 SVG exports). Every value is [VERIFY-DESIGN] per doc 08 §1.1-§1.4 unless its description marks it [PROPOSAL]. Figma export annotation chrome is excluded per doc 08 §1.1-1.2 (purple #8A38F5 dashed frames, 4.5px annotation radii, 20px annotation insets, artboard-scaled stroke copies 0.825/1.125/1.28571). Element sizes and layout (window 1920x1080, topbar 40, control bar 54, rail 50, playlist 377, control heights 28/32/34/36/48, item pitch 42) are NOT tokens — layout config owns them (doc 01 §2.3d). Layer grammar per doc 08 §3.2: primitive (raw, never consumed by components) -> alias (theme-role) -> semantic (the only consumable layer).",
  "$extensions": {
    "lumen.tokens": {
      "format": "W3C Design Tokens draft subset (nested groups, $value/$type/$description, {dotted.path} alias references, group $type inheritance) plus one lumen extension: a $value that is a JSON object whose keys are all registered mode names is a per-mode value [PROPOSAL — doc 08 §3.1 requires per-mode values; modes are not in the DTCG draft yet]",
      "modes": [
        "dark",
        "light"
      ],
      "default-mode": "dark",
      "accents": [
        "orange",
        "red",
        "yellow",
        "green",
        "cyan",
        "blue",
        "violet",
        "pink",
        "gray"
      ],
      "default-accent": "orange",
      "accent-primaries": {
        "orange": "{primitive.color.orange.500}",
        "red": "{primitive.color.accent.red}",
        "yellow": "{primitive.color.accent.yellow}",
        "green": "{primitive.color.accent.green}",
        "cyan": "{primitive.color.accent.cyan}",
        "blue": "{primitive.color.accent.blue}",
        "violet": "{primitive.color.accent.violet}",
        "pink": "{primitive.color.accent.pink}",
        "gray": "{primitive.color.accent.gray}"
      },
      "on-accent-candidates": [
        "{primitive.color.gray.750}",
        "{primitive.color.gray.900}",
        "{primitive.color.gray.100}",
        "{primitive.color.gray.0}"
      ],
      "accent-derivation": "alternate-accent ramps are computed by the theme-tokens crate (doc 08 §3.3): HSL shifts calibrated on the mined orange family, on-accent glyph chosen as the first candidate with WCAG contrast >= 4.5:1 against the accent primary — the candidates are the W25 neutrals #161616 (gray.750), #090909 (gray.900), #EAEAEA (gray.100) plus the pure-white fallback #FFFFFF (gray.0, [PROPOSAL — card 1.B4-R]) needed because the violet accent reaches 4.5:1 against none of the others; the default (orange) ramp is the mined family from the token file [re-pin when the Figma file provides the real ramps]",
      "provenance": "W25 spec §1 (design/figma-fidelity-spec.md, 2026-11-11): neutral near-black surfaces, one sparing orange accent, Inter face; hex frequency re-mined 2026-11 from design/figma/ (102 SVG exports) with scripts/extract_design_tokens.py methodology (doc 08 §1.2-§1.4)"
    }
  },
